## Why This Is Asked
Tests a blend of performance testing craft and real-world data consistency challenges in live collaboration.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end latency and tail behavior in WebSocket paths
- CRDT convergence under bursty edits and network jitter
- Backpressure, throughput budgeting, and backfilling in the event bus
- Soak and chaos testing to reveal bottlenecks and state-sync path risks

## Code Example
